and
Skills
Requirements:
Education
: bachelor’s degree in communications, International Development, or any other relevant social and behavioral science discipline.
Prior Work Experience
: Minimum of four years of
progressive professional management level
experience in program planning, implementation and coordination, preferably with an international humanitarian aid organization managing donor-funded projects.

